<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Jasco lifts half yr shr, no div.</title>
<headline>Jasco lifts half yr shr, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended August 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, attrib (cts)</p>
<p>    - diluted		 13.2	  vs 10.8</p>
<p>    - undiluted	     16.8	  vs 10.8</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   4.93	  vs 3.16</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   6.74	  vs 4.47</p>
<p>    Tax			 1.92	  vs 1.38</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   1.91	  vs 1.30</p>
<p>    Turnover		  91.72	 vs 56.09</p>
<p>Full name: Jasco Electronics Holdings Ltd (electronics &amp; electrical)</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said profits for the second half of the year should be in line with those achieved in the first half. However, the Datatrak/Trakbak vehicle tracking project was not likely to make any contribution to profits in this financial year, they said. Order books looked good, directors said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
